{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ScheduleBuilder","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ScheduledSystem","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemSet","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/CyclicOrdering","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Ambiguity"],"title":"Building and Running Schedules","generated":true,"anchor":"Building-and-Running-Schedules"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/schedule"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Schedule","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7Systems8ScheduleV","symbolKind":"struct","title":"Schedule","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Schedule"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Schedule.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Schedule.swift#L100"},"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A list of systems that run on a world, in order, and at the same time where they can.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/init(checked:)","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ScheduleBuilder","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/CyclicOrdering"],"title":"Creating a Schedule","anchor":"Creating-a-Schedule"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/run(on:)","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/runSerially(on:)"],"title":"Running Systems","